          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "Xref",
      "code_hash": "1326dd4c977900e85f02f3c5d322b13a",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"the-centring-keeps-the-predictions\">The centring keeps the predictions</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The intercept plus the centred score of each feature gives the same probabilities as the EBM, because the centring\nonly adds one number per bin to all the classes. The cell compares them for the first five flowers.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "SFPL",
      "code_hash": "464a14c9e7e16407c0e83c5292930f1c",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The largest difference from <code>ebm.predict_proba</code> is <code>2.7e-20</code>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
